IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `aa-estates`

-- Administration Act 1903 (WA), ss 8, 12A, 13(1a), 14, 15, 25, 32, 36, 37, 42, 44, 55, 71, 139, 143A, Fourth Schedule -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_wa_administration-act-1903_baseline.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

-- Facts from the WA lives (workbench scenarios au/wa/cradle-to-grave-{chloe,jake,daniel}). The scenarios give no value
-- for Sue's estate, Jake's apartment or the other estates, so every dollar figure used with them is the encoder's,
-- chosen for arithmetic. Where a scenario does not name the executor, an adult executor living in WA is assumed.

